      ],
      "image": "assets/images/217890/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine ranch dressing, sour cream, 1 teaspoon taco seasoning, and salsa in a small bowl. Cover and refrigerate until serving.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/9gLeeHwdkwf4GVXMUygy58Oqqnk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/217890-ranch-chicken-tacos-VAT-006-step-02-0a93f9cd064c4df7978b3d1e8f464a23.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/217890/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Toss chicken with remaining taco seasoning. Cover bowl loosely with wax paper or plastic wrap. Microwave chicken until chicken is heated through, about 2 to 3 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/xCkxbJzxad-hgfVN9nw1uARgeB4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/217890-ranch-chicken-tacos-VAT-007-step-03-25f16640c79c43f3987df573977f1450.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/217890/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Warm tortillas in a skillet for about a minute on each side to make them pliable.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
